sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  actor M as Mentor
  participant IO as Socket.IO gateway
  participant RS as RoomService
  participant RR as RoomRepo
  S->>IO: room:join {roomId}
  IO->>RS: getRoom(student, roomId)
  RS-->>IO: room (participant ✓, remainingSeconds)
  IO-->>S: ack {ok, room}  + joins "room:<id>"
  M->>IO: room:join {roomId}
  IO-->>M: ack {ok, room}
  M->>IO: room:message {text}
  IO->>RS: postMessage(mentor, roomId, text)
  RS->>RS: check participant + not locked (now < expiresAt, status active)
  RS->>RR: addMessage()
  RS-->>IO: emit room:message → "room:<id>"
  IO-->>S: room:message
  IO-->>M: room:message
  Note over S,M: after expiresAt → 423 Locked (read-only)
